{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダースペシャルライブ\n詳細発表されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月3日(土)\n渋谷TSUTAYA O-EAST\n12:00〜\n15:00〜\n18:00〜\nライブ3回！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月17日(土)\nポートメッセ名古屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19:00〜\n全国握手会終了後"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です！\n素敵なライブにしたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ応募してください！\nよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/30/1038625/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいお誕生日おめでとう！\nよくじゃれ合うゆるーい仲なの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くだらない話するの楽しい♪\nかまってくれるまいまいの優しさに\nいつも感動してます。すきだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/30/1038625/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はさゆと夢の国へ行きました。\n私は中2以来でした。\n4年ぶり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はパンケーキ\n行く約束だったんだけど\n私が突然ディズニー行きたい！\nって言ったらじゃあ行こう！と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも方向音痴で\nすっごい道間違えて無駄に歩いた泣\n地図見てもわからないとか泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ並んで乗ったら\nお昼にお肉食べよう！\nっていう目標立てて\nお肉食べるために頑張ってた。\n楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/30/1038625/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/30/1038625/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見にくいけど今日の格好！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/30/1038625/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部古着〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}